		"@.*-(atriplexnummularia|eremophilalatrobei|calytrixtetragona|gossypiumsturtianum|hakearostrata|ipomoeacostata|ixodiaachillaeoides|maireanasedifolia|gossypiumsturtianum|ptilotusexaltatus|sennapleurocarpa|thryptomenemicrantha)-.*" : {"place": "game:block/plant","break": "game:block/plant","hit": "game:block/plant","walk": "game:walk/grass","inside": "game:walk/inside/leafy/bushrustle*"},
